8. Conclusion

The online canteen food ordering system using PWA is a useful solution for college students. It reduces waiting time, makes ordering easier and saves time. It also helps canteen staff manage orders efficiently. Therefore, PWA is a suitable choice for developing an online canteen ordering system.
